{"id":"doc-westflex","rules":[{"id":"doc-westflex:suitability:9e32df94","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"environment":["external","floor","internal","wall"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Westflex adhesive can be used on both walls and floors, in interior and exterior applications.","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/dms/getdocument.get/5855b88c-614a-4ac9-bbab-73dbe81f8b7a/westflex.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"April 2022, Version 01.01","section":"USES","web_url":null}},{"id":"doc-westflex:suitability:b43de9fe","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["brick_block","cement_render","cement_screed","concrete","fibre_cement","plasterboard","waterproofing_membrane"],"tile_type":["ceramic"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Westflex adhesive can be used to fix tiles onto concrete, cement renders/screeds, blockwork, rendered brickwork, plasterboard, fibre cement sheeting, old ceramic tiles and waterproofing membranes.","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/dms/getdocument.get/5855b88c-614a-4ac9-bbab-73dbe81f8b7a/westflex.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"April 2022, Version 01.01","section":"USES","web_url":null}},{"id":"doc-westflex:suitability:637bdf59","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"tile_type":["ceramic","mosaic","natural_stone","porcelain","terracotta"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Westflex adhesive is recommended for thin or thick bed fixing of all types of ceramic, mosaic, fully vitrified, porcelain, terracotta, slate, quarry, granite and marble tiles.","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/dms/getdocument.get/5855b88c-614a-4ac9-bbab-73dbe81f8b7a/westflex.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"April 2022, Version 01.01","section":"USES","web_url":null}},{"id":"doc-westflex:suitability:005a5161","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":